      "writtenOn": "2026-08-04T20:28:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "An empty SHA-256 remote has no refs, so `git ls-remote` succeeds with empty output and this falls back to SHA-1. The callers then initialize a SHA-1 repo, and fetching after the first SHA-256 ref is created fails with `fatal: mismatched algorithms`.",
      "revId": "0040a86dc00b4f6039273b7f99d25c0e97974487",
